    "title_en": null,
    "impact": null,
    "summary": "Saudi Aramco launched today, January 26, 2026, the sale of international bonds under its Global Medium Term Note Programme. The proposed bonds are USD-denominated, direct, general, unconditional, and unsecured obligations. The offer value will be determined based on market conditions. The subscription period starts from January 26, 2026, to February 2, 2026, with a minimum subscription limit of $200,000. The bonds will be issued in accordance with the U.S. Securities Act, and the redemption terms will depend on market conditions."
