    "title": "Aramco completes $3B international sukuk issuance",
    "title_en": null,
    "impact": null,
    "summary": "Saudi Aramco completed the issuance of $3 billion international sukuk under SA Global Sukuk Limited’s Trust Certificate Issuance Program. The sukuk will trade on the London Stock Exchange’s Main Market. This issuance includes a total of 15,000 certificates with a nominal value of $200,000 each, offering returns of 4.125% for 5 years and 4.625% for 10 years. The issuance complies with relevant legal requirements and FCA stabilization rules."
   },
   {
