    "impact": null,
    "summary": "Saudi Aramco announced the start of issuing USD-denominated international sukuk under its trust certificate issuance program, set to begin on September 10, 2025, and end on September 17, 2025. The sukuk will be direct, unsubordinated, unsecured, and limited recourse obligations targeting institutional investors. The minimum subscription value is $200,000, subject to market conditions. Funds will be used for general corporate purposes."
